Adaptation_method:
Update queue method usage to handle the new awaitable behavior:

1. Previous callback approach (still supported):
```javascript
q.drain(function() {
  console.log('all items have been processed');
});

q.error(function(err, task) {
  console.error('task experienced an error');
});
```

2. New promise-based approach:
```javascript
// Using await
await q.drain();

// Or using then/catch
q.drain().then(() => {
  console.log('all items have been processed');
});
```
